  npcName: The man at the gate
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 3295236706101327806, guid: 5b41caec533a48243a1deada31ac3879, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - No name worth giving, friend. Names cost more than coppers out here.
  - The bowl takes what the day allows. The gate takes everyone, eventually.
  - Eastway? Then you'll pass the stone. Nod to it. Costs nothing. Might be worth
    something.
